Instructor portraits.

Git does not track empty directories, so this file exists to keep the folder
present in the repository — which also means you can upload images straight
into it from GitHub's web interface.

Expected files are named by the instructor's id in src/lib/seed/about.ts:

  che-gary.jpg    -> referenced as /img/instructors/che-gary.jpg

Rendered by Dossier.astro in a 240x240 square, so square crops work best.
Roughly 600x600 is ample: it covers a 2x retina display with room to spare,
and anything larger is bytes the visitor downloads but never sees.
